# runtime/LFAC.1.7.2_key_all_relation's four asserts, in its order, against
# fixture 73's key = one slot schema.
#
# (1,"x") enters. (1,"x") again is a no-op reassert [LFAC.2.5.1] and must emit
# nothing. (1,"y") is a meaningful change on the same key, which [LFAC.2.5.3]
# makes a FACT_RETRACT(old) + FACT_ASSERT(new) pair and not a second fact.
# (2,"x") is a new identity.
#
# Two facts live at the end. The conformance vector, whose schema keys both
# slots, leaves three.
assert Pair a=1 b=x
assert Pair a=1 b=x
assert Pair a=1 b=y
assert Pair a=2 b=x
pump
